## .gitignore for Prior Authorization Workflow Tracker
## ASP.NET Core Blazor Server / .NET 9 / EF Core / SQL Server LocalDB

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
logs/

# ── Visual Studio ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vscode/

# ── NuGet packages ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/
!**/packages/build/
nuget.config
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ── ASP.NET Core / runtime ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# User secrets (never commit these)
**/secrets.json
**/*.Development.json
# Keep appsettings.json (contains only non-sensitive defaults)
!appsettings.json

# Published output
[Pp]ublish/
PublishProfiles/

# ── SQL Server LocalDB files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

# ── Serilog rolling log files ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── Test results ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.opencover.xml

# ── OS generated files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ── Rider ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.sln.iml

replace_nav.html
